---
title: "corsSetup (stem-bot-v2: src/index.ts CORS configuration)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_env: check process.env.ALLOWED_ORIGINS
    q_check_env --> q_split: ALLOWED_ORIGINS is set
    q_check_env --> q_wildcard: ALLOWED_ORIGINS not set
    q_split --> q_apply: origin = ALLOWED_ORIGINS.split(",")
    q_wildcard --> q_apply: origin = "*"
    q_apply --> [*]: app.use(cors(corsOptions))

    note right of q_wildcard
        INV-001: Default CORS origin is "*" (allows all origins)
        INV-002: credentials = true with origin "*" is a CORS misconfiguration
        INV-003: maxAge = 86400 (24h preflight cache)
    end note
